msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"This is the only shop in town that sells the kinda\r\n"
"underhanded stuff you're looking for. This guy here\r\n"
"is an associate of mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "It's, uh... Hm. Quite a setup."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"Hey, don't knock mobility! Anything that can help you get\r\n"
"away from the fuzz is a positive in my book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "...Right. I take it this is your store, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Oh, heavens no. This one's all handled by my pal here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"My own shop is up on the second floor of a building near the\r\n"
"Ryudo office. That's where I sell gear, and mod stuff, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "<Color:7>Near the Ryudo office<Color:Default>, huh...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"I wish I could just give you everything you need to crush\r\n"
"the Tamashiro... but remember I'm running a business here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Let me see... Here, this should get your engine started."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "You got an <Color:8>Extendable Staff<Color:Default>!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Equip <Color:200,255,200,255>weapons, armor, and accessories<Color:Default> "
"by selecting\r\n"
"the <Color:200,255,200,255>Items<Color:Default> option on the pause menu.\r\n"
"During battle, take out any equipped "
"<Color:200,255,200,255>weapon<Color:Default>\r\n"
"using "
"<Action:Battle_Pull_Weapon_Left@Combat><Action:Battle_Pull_Weapon_"
"Up@Combat><Action:Battle_Pull_Weapon_Right@Combat>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Armor and accessories will have no effect\r\n"
"unless you remember to <Color:200,255,200,255>equip<Color:Default> them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "This should come in handy. Thanks, Kamiyama."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"Oh, it's no problem at all. That's one of our most popular\r\n"
"items."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Ah, and remember that weapons will break as you use them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"If that ever happens, just bring it up to my shop and I'll\r\n"
"fix it up for you in no time flat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Though don't expect me to work for free..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Free or not, that's a pretty good deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"By the way, you guys have a lot of weapons I've never\r\n"
"even seen before. It's incredible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"Oh, have our wares caught your eye? I know a guy who can\r\n"
"teach you how to use them if you want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "A weapons expert, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Yes, yes. I'll mention you to him. I'm sure he'd be thrilled\r\n"
"to have a student as beefy as you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"Oh, and just holler if you need anything else. I'll help\r\n"
"you as much as I humanly can. After all, the Tamashiro'll\r\n"
"come for my legs, maybe more, if you fail..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Let's hope I don't fail then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Yeah. Feel free to stop by my shop when you have the time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "I will. Thanks, Kamiyama."
msgstr ""

